  {
   "id": "0Lirqs7eAQAJ",
   "from": "Neutronstar21",
   "author": "01668e867549c468",
   "date": "2022-04-12T02:35:39Z",
   "subject": "the new gl2genepop() is excellent!",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Thanks so much for putting this converter in. The genepop format is so widely used.<div><br></div><div>However, it would be very useful to have a parameter option that forces the pops to be written out in a predetermined order</div><div><br></div><div>something like:</div><div>pop_order_list = c(Z, X, Y)</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks again for dartR!</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Dean</div><div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "uV-fRHusBAAJ",
   "from": "Bernd.Gruber",
   "author": "b3d929c6746ca81a",
   "date": "2022-04-12T02:52:04Z",
   "subject": "RE: [dartR] the new gl2genepop() is excellent!",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Hi Dean,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>That is a good suggestion as I had once a problem that the order was changing. So we will take that onboard and allow to have the order specified.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Currently the order is done via:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>order(pop(x))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>means it is ordered by the pop (and alphatically).<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>So the “trick” until we implement it,  is to relabel the pop factor, so that population order and alphabetical order are identical<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>You can do that via<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>#check the levels <u></u>\r\n<u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>levels(pop(pp))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>levels(pop(pp)) &lt;- c(…yournewlables in the order, that the alphabetical order matches the one you want to have in the genepop output)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Admittedly not really a good solution, but should work.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Cheers, Bernd<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">==============================================================================<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Dr Bernd Gruber\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                            )/_         \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                                         _.--..---&quot;-,--c_    \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Professor Ecological Modelling</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                      \\|..&#39;           ._O__)_     \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Tel: (02)\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">6206 3804                     \r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">   ,=.    _.+   _ \\..--( /          \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Fax:\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">(02) 6201 2328</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                           \\\\.-&#39;&#39;_.-&#39; \\ (     \\_          \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p c