 &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [dartR] the new gl2genepop() is excellent!<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks so much for putting this converter in. The genepop format is so widely used.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">However, it would be very useful to have a parameter option that forces the pops to be written out in a predetermined order<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">something like:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">pop_order_list = c(Z, X, Y)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks again for dartR!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Cheers,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dean<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div><div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/a7839c77-7115-496d-9930-9d097ac8f0b6n%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/a7839c77-7115-496d-9930-9d097ac8f0b6n%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_